### VResume Pages Testing - HTTP Requests
### 
### Comprehensive HTTP request definitions for testing all VResume pages and endpoints.
### Use with VS Code REST Client extension (humao.rest-client)
###
### Features:
### - Tests all main pages (Home, About, Resume, Portfolio, Blog, Contact)
### - Tests modal endpoints (Project detail, Blog detail)
### - Tests form submissions (Contact form, Newsletter subscription)
### - Tests error cases (404s, validation errors)
### - Tests HTMX navigation
###
### Usage:
### 1. Install REST Client extension in VS Code
### 2. Open this file
### 3. Click "Send Request" on any request
### 4. Or use "Send All Requests in File" to run all tests

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@contentType = application/x-www-form-urlencoded

### ============================================
### 1. TAB VIEWS - Main Pages
### ============================================

### 1.1 Home Tab
GET {{baseUrl}}/pages/home/ HTTP/1.1
Accept: text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8

### 1.2 About Tab
GET {{baseUrl}}/pages/about/ HTTP/1.1
Accept: text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8

### 1.3 Resume Tab
GET {{baseUrl}}/pages/resume/ HTTP/1.1
Accept: text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8

### 1.4 Portfolio Tab
GET {{baseUrl}}/pages/portfolio/ HTTP/1.1
Accept: text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8

### 1.5 Blog Tab
GET {{baseUrl}}/pages/blog/ HTTP/1.1
Accept: text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8

### 1.6 Contact Tab
GET {{baseUrl}}/pages/contact/ HTTP/1.1
Accept: text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8

### ============================================
### 2. HTMX FRAGMENT REQUESTS - Tab Fragments
### ============================================

### 2.1 Home Fragment (HTMX)
GET {{baseUrl}}/pages/home/ HTTP/1.1
HX-Request: true
Accept: text/html

### 2.2 About Fragment (HTMX)
GET {{baseUrl}}/pages/about/ HTTP/1.1
HX-Request: true
Accept: text/html

### 2.3 Resume Fragment (HTMX)
GET {{baseUrl}}/pages/resume/ HTTP/1.1
HX-Request: true
Accept: text/html

### 2.4 Portfolio Fragment (HTMX)
GET {{baseUrl}}/pages/portfolio/ HTTP/1.1
HX-Request: true
Accept: text/html

### 2.5 Blog Fragment (HTMX)
GET {{baseUrl}}/pages/blog/ HTTP/1.1
HX-Request: true
Accept: text/html

### 2.6 Contact Fragment (HTMX)
GET {{baseUrl}}/pages/contact/ HTTP/1.1
HX-Request: true
Accept: text/html

### ============================================
### 3. PROJECT DETAIL MODAL
### ============================================

### 3.1 Project Detail (replace with actual project_id)
GET {{baseUrl}}/pages/project/project-1/ HTTP/1.1
HX-Request: true
Accept: text/html

### 3.2 Project Detail Alternative ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/pages/project/project-2/ HTTP/1.1
HX-Request: true
Accept: text/html

### ============================================
### 4. BLOG DETAIL MODAL
### ============================================

### 4.1 Blog Detail (replace with actual blog_id)
GET {{baseUrl}}/pages/blog/1/ HTTP/1.1
HX-Request: true
Accept: text/html

### 4.2 Blog Detail Alternative ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/pages/blog/2/ HTTP/1.1
HX-Request: true
Accept: text/html

### ============================================
### 5. FORM SUBMISSIONS
### ============================================

### 5.1 Contact Form Submission
POST {{baseUrl}}/pages/contact/submit/ HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
HX-Request: true

fullname=John Doe&email=john@example.com&message=This is a test message

### 5.2 Contact Form - Missing Name
POST {{baseUrl}}/pages/contact/submit/ HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
HX-Request: true

email=john@example.com&message=This is a test message

### 5.3 Contact Form - Missing Email
POST {{baseUrl}}/pages/contact/submit/ HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
HX-Request: true

fullname=John Doe&message=This is a test message

### 5.4 Contact Form - Missing Message
POST {{baseUrl}}/pages/contact/submit/ HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
HX-Request: true

fullname=John Doe&email=john@example.com

### ============================================
### 6. NEWSLETTER SUBSCRIPTION
### ============================================

### 6.1 Subscribe - Valid Email
POST {{baseUrl}}/pages/subscribe/ HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
HX-Request: true

email=subscriber@example.com

### 6.2 Subscribe - Duplicate Email
POST {{baseUrl}}/pages/subscribe/ HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
HX-Request: true

email=subscriber@example.com

### 6.3 Subscribe - Empty Email
POST {{baseUrl}}/pages/subscribe/ HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
HX-Request: true

email=

### ============================================
### 7. BLOG APP ENDPOINTS
### ============================================

### 7.1 Blog List
GET {{baseUrl}}/pages/blog/ HTTP/1.1
Accept: text/html

### 7.2 Blog Post Preview (replace with actual pk)
GET {{baseUrl}}/blog/preview/1/ HTTP/1.1
HX-Request: true
Accept: text/html

### ============================================
### 8. CONNECT APP ENDPOINTS
### ============================================

### 8.1 Communications/Connect Page
GET {{baseUrl}}/pages/comm/ HTTP/1.1
Accept: text/html

### ============================================
### 9. ERROR CASES - Testing 404s
### ============================================

### 9.1 Invalid Tab
GET {{baseUrl}}/pages/invalid-tab/ HTTP/1.1
Accept: text/html

### 9.2 Invalid Project ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/pages/project/nonexistent/ HTTP/1.1
HX-Request: true
Accept: text/html

### 9.3 Invalid Blog ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/pages/blog/9999/ HTTP/1.1
HX-Request: true
Accept: text/html
